		"description": "<p><em>Flamethrower — Toolbelt option.</em></p><p><strong>Napalm — 2 Actions, 1 Toolbelt scrap.</strong> Reach 4, Wall 4. Lasts 1 minute or until dispersed. Targets that start or end a turn adjacent to it or enter an adjacent space take KEY Fire damage. Ignores armor.</p><p><strong>High Levels:</strong> +2 damage every 5 levels.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 1 Toolbelt scrap — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] The KEY Fire damage (+2 per 5 levels, ignores armor) is posted unrolled — press Roll Damage when a creature triggers the wall.</em></p><p><em>[M] Place the wall yourself; it lasts 1 minute or until dispersed.</em></p>",
